//--- one pass, three running dot products; prices[0] must be the
//--- OLDEST bar in the window and prices[m_window-1] the most recently
//--- closed bar, matching the i=0..N-1 convention the kernels were
//--- solved under in Init()
for
(
int
i=
0
;i<m_window;i++)
